{"data":{"allProjectsJson":{"nodes":[{"link":"https://github.com/ryancrwll/EventCamera3DReconstruction","name":[["en","Underwater 3D Reconstruction with Event-Based Cameras"],["es","Reconstrucción 3D Submarina con Cámaras de Eventos"]],"image":{"publicURL":"/static/7dca49888cc007aeea94164a1cb37317/ebc.jpg","childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"backgroundColor":"transparent","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/7dca49888cc007aeea94164a1cb37317/28c41/ebc.webp","srcSet":"/static/7dca49888cc007aeea94164a1cb37317/12319/ebc.webp 360w,\n/static/7dca49888cc007aeea94164a1cb37317/960f4/ebc.webp 480w,\n/static/7dca49888cc007aeea94164a1cb37317/ad7c6/ebc.webp 640w,\n/static/7dca49888cc007aeea94164a1cb37317/30c5c/ebc.webp 720w,\n/static/7dca49888cc007aeea94164a1cb37317/0a042/ebc.webp 1080w,\n/static/7dca49888cc007aeea94164a1cb37317/28c41/ebc.webp 2048w","sizes":"(min-width: 2048px) 2048px, 100vw"},"sources":[]},"width":2048,"height":1536}}},"year":2026,"description":[["en","A specialized pipeline for refractive calibration of event-based cameras using MCAP data coded in C++. This accurately reconstructs the scene for both underwater and surface scenarios with look up tables, creating the first of its kind."],["es","Un pipeline especializado para la calibración refractiva de cámaras basadas en eventos utilizando datos MCAP codificados en C++. Esto reconstruye con precisión la escena tanto para escenarios submarinos como de superficie con tablas de consulta, creando el primero de su tipo."]]},{"link":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qd8FpeB22IE","name":[["en","Pick and Place Behavior Tree"],["es","Árbol de comportamiento de recogida y colocación"]],"image":{"publicURL":"/static/6e8fe19c82e17851e0289c8de6683cd7/6DOF_behaviour_tree.jpg","childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"backgroundColor":"transparent","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/6e8fe19c82e17851e0289c8de6683cd7/55ea5/6DOF_behaviour_tree.webp","srcSet":"/static/6e8fe19c82e17851e0289c8de6683cd7/55ea5/6DOF_behaviour_tree.webp 270w","sizes":"(min-width: 270px) 270px, 100vw"},"sources":[]},"width":270,"height":192}}},"year":2025,"description":[["en","An automated pick-and-place system for a mobile manipulator (TurtleBot 2 + uArm SwiftPro). Utilizes a custom Behavior Tree to orchestrate task-priority inverse kinematics and ArUco marker detection for precise object manipulation."],["es","Un sistema automatizado de recogida y colocación para un manipulador móvil (TurtleBot 2 + uArm SwiftPro). Utiliza un árbol de comportamiento personalizado para orquestar la cinemática inversa de prioridad de tareas y la detección de marcadores ArUco para la manipulación precisa de objetos."]]},{"link":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4roI57UxnEw","name":[["en","Global Local Planner (DWA/RRT*) with Frontier Search"],["es","Planificador Global Local (DWA/RRT*) con Búsqueda de Frontera"]],"image":{"publicURL":"/static/feee91bef1c83d7bb349a5f1d9f9dacc/DWAcontroller.png","childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"backgroundColor":"transparent","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/feee91bef1c83d7bb349a5f1d9f9dacc/bda7f/DWAcontroller.webp","srcSet":"/static/feee91bef1c83d7bb349a5f1d9f9dacc/9b008/DWAcontroller.webp 360w,\n/static/feee91bef1c83d7bb349a5f1d9f9dacc/bbc1e/DWAcontroller.webp 480w,\n/static/feee91bef1c83d7bb349a5f1d9f9dacc/bda7f/DWAcontroller.webp 512w","sizes":"(min-width: 512px) 512px, 100vw"},"sources":[]},"width":512,"height":464}}},"year":2025,"description":[["en","An autonomous exploration pipeline for GPS-denied environments. Integrates Frontier-Based Exploration (using RRT*/A*), EKF-SLAM fusing LiDAR/IMU data, and a Dynamic Window Approach (DWA) controller for safe, real-time obstacle avoidance."],["es","Un proceso de exploración autónoma para entornos sin GPS. Integra la exploración basada en fronteras (usando RRT*/A*), EKF-SLAM que fusiona datos LiDAR/IMU, y un controlador de Enfoque de Ventana Dinámica (DWA) para la evasión de obstáculos segura y en tiempo real."]]},{"link":null,"name":[["en","Side Scan Sonar (SSS) Image Rectification"],["es","Rectificación de imágenes de sonar de barrido lateral"]],"image":{"publicURL":"/static/edc3c791add86620bb94cf6af3b44bfd/girona500.png","childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"backgroundColor":"transparent","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/edc3c791add86620bb94cf6af3b44bfd/2faa6/girona500.webp","srcSet":"/static/edc3c791add86620bb94cf6af3b44bfd/2faa6/girona500.webp 272w","sizes":"(min-width: 272px) 272px, 100vw"},"sources":[]},"width":272,"height":260}}},"year":2025,"description":[["en","A specialized pipeline for rectifying Side-Scan Sonar (SSS) imagery using XTF and ROSbag data. This process significantly improves feature alignment, enabling robust Graph-SLAM and multi-modal seabed mapping for AUVs."],["es","Un proceso especializado para rectificar imágenes de sonar de barrido lateral (SSS) utilizando datos XTF y ROSbag. Este proceso mejora significativamente la alineación de características, permitiendo un Graph-SLAM robusto y un mapeo del lecho marino multimodal para AUVs."]]},{"link":"https://github.com/ryancrwll/aml_project","name":[["en","Event-based Camera SLAM with RNN-GRU"],["es","SLAM de cámara de eventos con RNN-GRU"]],"image":{"publicURL":"/static/da34c84f738ceb8ce5c25157f96c5ed0/ebc_slam_RNN-GRU.png","childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"backgroundColor":"transparent","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/da34c84f738ceb8ce5c25157f96c5ed0/58865/ebc_slam_RNN-GRU.webp","srcSet":"/static/da34c84f738ceb8ce5c25157f96c5ed0/58865/ebc_slam_RNN-GRU.webp 312w","sizes":"(min-width: 312px) 312px, 100vw"},"sources":[]},"width":312,"height":237.00000000000003}}},"year":2025,"description":[["en","This implements a Deep Event Inertial Odometry system using PyTorch. It processes event camera streams (from MVSEC) and IMU data to estimate 6-DOF pose, comparing performance against frame-based stereo baselines."],["es","Esto implementa un sistema de Odometría Inercial de Eventos Profundos utilizando PyTorch. Procesa flujos de cámaras de eventos (de MVSEC) y datos del IMU para estimar la pose de 6 DOF, comparando el rendimiento contra líneas de base estéreo basadas en fotogramas."]]},{"link":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4YgDE8ocnk","name":[["en","Aruco Pose Estimation SLAM"],["es","Estimación de Pose de Aruco SLAM"]],"image":{"publicURL":"/static/04549141ff93207f9e77a5cfc9d2aca9/arucoSLAMirl.png","childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"backgroundColor":"transparent","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/04549141ff93207f9e77a5cfc9d2aca9/a86b8/arucoSLAMirl.webp","srcSet":"/static/04549141ff93207f9e77a5cfc9d2aca9/9edc9/arucoSLAMirl.webp 360w,\n/static/04549141ff93207f9e77a5cfc9d2aca9/9407d/arucoSLAMirl.webp 480w,\n/static/04549141ff93207f9e77a5cfc9d2aca9/a86b8/arucoSLAMirl.webp 512w","sizes":"(min-width: 512px) 512px, 100vw"},"sources":[]},"width":512,"height":299}}},"year":2022,"description":[["en","A marker-based localization system mapping ArUco tags in a 3D environment. By fusing multiple detected markers through a transformation tree, it achieves robust pose estimation that effectively corrects odometry drift in both simulated and real-world conditions."],["es","Un sistema de localización basado en marcadores que mapea etiquetas ArUco en un entorno 3D. Al fusionar múltiples marcadores detectados a través de un árbol de transformación, logra una estimación de pose robusta que corrige eficazmente la deriva de la odometría tanto en condiciones simuladas como reales."]]}]}}}